v 3
* the content files
d Workflow tools by Yongyi Zeng (Xiamen University, <zzyy@xmu.edu.cn>)
d A collection of packages I have written for a replicable and efficient 
d research workflow in Stata.
p xhelp.pkg   Tools to install, create and display translated help files.
p xmkdo.pkg   Scaffolding for sensible do-files.
p xproj.pkg   Tools to make, manage and build project in Stata.
p xdtree.pkg  Display directory structure in a tree-like format.
